File mode prints the frontmatter fields as the header, single-quoted values re-quoted with double quotes, then each heading with a line range running to the end of its section.
== args
input/sample.md
== file input/sample.md
---
title: 'Sample doc'
owner: 'docs-team'
---

# Overview

## Scope

### Notes
== stdout
input/sample.md (10 lines)
title: "Sample doc"
owner: "docs-team"
[L6-L10] # Overview
[L8-L10] ## Scope
[L10-L10] ### Notes
== stderr
== exit 0
